/* BGMAppDelegate.mm */

"Background Music needs permission to use microphones." = "Background Music 需要使用麦克风的权限。";

"It uses a virtual microphone to access your system's audio.\n\nYou can grant the permission by going to System Preferences > Security and Privacy > Microphone and checking the box for Background Music." = "它需要通过虚拟麦克风来获取系统音频。\n\n你可以前往“系统偏好设置 > 安全性与隐私 > 麦克风”，勾选 Background Music 来授予该权限。";

"Could not set the Background Music device as yourdefault audio device." = "无法将 Background Music 设备设为你的默认音频输出设备。";

"You might be able to change it yourself." = "你可以尝试自己手动修改。";

"Failed to reset your system's audio output device." = "重置系统音频输出设备失败。";

"You'll have to change it yourself to get audio working again." = "你需要自己手动修改，才能让音频重新正常工作。";

"Could not find the Background Music virtual audio device." = "找不到 Background Music 虚拟音频设备。";

"Make sure you've installed Background Music Device.driver to /Library/Audio/Plug-Ins/HAL and restarted coreaudiod (e.g. \"sudo killall coreaudiod\")." = "请确认已将 Background Music Device.driver 安装到 /Library/Audio/Plug-Ins/HAL，并重启了 coreaudiod（例如执行 \"sudo killall coreaudiod\"）。";

"Failed to set the output device." = "设置输出设备失败。";

"Could not start the device '%@'. (Error: %ld)" = "无法启动设备“%@”。（错误代码：%ld）";

"Could not find an audio output device." = "找不到音频输出设备。";

"If you do have one installed, this is probably a bug. Sorry about that. Feel free to file an issue on GitHub." = "如果你确实安装了输出设备，这可能是个 bug，抱歉给你带来困扰。欢迎在 GitHub 上提交 issue。";

"Error connecting to BGMXPCHelper." = "连接 BGMXPCHelper 时出错。";

"Make sure you have BGMXPCHelper installed. There are instructions in the README.md file.\n\nBackground Music might still work, but it won't work as well as it could." = "请确认已安装 BGMXPCHelper，具体步骤请参考 README.md 文件。\n\nBackground Music 或许仍能工作，但效果会打折扣。";

"\n\nDetails:\n" = "\n\n详细信息：\n";

"OK" = "好";

"Open Sound in System Preferences" = "在系统偏好设置中打开声音";

